  <title xml:lang="EN">Local Cooperation Fund (LCF) in South Africa</title>
  <description xml:lang="EN">TLAC was estabilshed in 1996, to undertake Legal advocacy to eradicate the victimisation of women by the law and the legal system , and to make the legal system a vehicle for Social change for women. Training on the sexual offences Act will be conducted for community based organisations and police officers in the rural areas of Mpumalanga, and Advocacy campaigns will be organised with different partners.</description>
